---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Main
  title="SyncID Labs - Actualizing Canada's strategic futures"
  description="SyncID Labs builds the innovation district, the founder and research pipelines, and the coalitions of ventures that turn foresight into a sovereign, economically powerful Canada."
  lang="en"
  activePath="/"
>
  <!-- Hero (dark band) -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-950 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400">SyncID Labs</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
        SyncID Labs actualizes Canada's strategic futures.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-neutral-300">
        We build the innovation district, the founder and research pipelines, and the coalitions
        of ventures that turn foresight into a sovereign, economically powerful Canada.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="/en/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white"
          style="background-color: var(--wk-accent);"
        >
          Start a conversation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The stakes -->
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-neutral-900">
        Canadian productivity has fallen to 71% of the US level.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">Bank of Canada, 2024</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The district -->
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-neutral-700">
        A dense, mixed-use innovation district on 89 acres in Markham, built to keep Canadian
        talent, IP, and value at home.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/en/district"
        class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium"
        style="color: var(--wk-accent);">See the district</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three doors -->
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-px bg-neutral-200 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-white p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Capital</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">
            A de-risked, methodology-backed coalition play toward defined Canadian futures.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-white p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Institutions</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">
            Bring your research and your alumni to a district built for actualizing Canada's futures.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-white p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Founders</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">
            Place, peers, mission, and mentorship, alongside top researchers in Markham.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Credibility strip -->
  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-neutral-700">
        Venture-studio pioneer since 2013. A proven Hybrid Intelligence&trade; methodology. A
        research-backed problem statement and a sized, multi-trillion-dollar opportunity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Main>
